# NIRU calendar settings (user-owned, edited in the TUI with `s`).
#
# To sync (read-only) with Google Calendar:
#   Google Calendar -> Settings -> <your calendar> -> "Secret address in
#   iCal format" -> copy the URL below. Editing still happens in the web app;
#   press `o` in the calendar to open the selected day in Google Calendar.
#
# Leave empty to disable syncing (the calendar still works).
ICS_URL=
